WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.975 --> 00:00:06.373
Maya has too many cards for her little shelf, and it is about to burst!

3
00:00:06.812 --> 00:00:10.079
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:10.518 --> 00:00:12.546
This is Episode 80.

5
00:00:12.985 --> 00:00:14.860
Meet the shelf-tower.

6
00:00:15.299 --> 00:00:19.379
It is tall, very tall, with hundreds of tiny drawers.

7
00:00:19.818 --> 00:00:24.606
Every card goes in its own drawer, cups with cups, lemons with lemons.

8
00:00:25.045 --> 00:00:28.064
Ask a big question: cups sold at night?

9
00:00:28.504 --> 00:00:31.016
Hundreds of drawers open at once.

10
00:00:31.455 --> 00:00:33.967
The answer stacks up in a second.

11
00:00:34.406 --> 00:00:37.401
Millions of cards, one quick answer.

12
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.434
The little shelf is for a few cards.

13
00:00:40.873 --> 00:00:43.680
The tower is for a whole town of cards.

14
00:00:44.119 --> 00:00:46.407
That is Amazon Redshift.

15
00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:51.162
A giant warehouse for your data, built to answer big questions fast.

16
00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:53.676
Now you know the shelf-tower!

17
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

